# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Investo-specific
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The raw-payload cache. Content-addressed and append-only (DESIGN.md §4.4), so it is
# reproducible by refetching and has no business in version control — a warm cache for a
# handful of tickers runs to hundreds of megabytes of EDGAR JSON.
#
# It is ignored rather than absent from the tree on purpose: `investo fetch` recreates it, and
# a committed cache would freeze `fetched_at` timestamps that provenance treats as meaningful.
.cache/
cache/

# Generated reports. `investo analyze` writes report.pdf and report.json here by default.
reports/

# Local config. The TOML config file is per-machine — it carries a User-Agent with a real
# contact email in it (DESIGN.md §4.1), which is exactly the kind of thing that should not be
# committed on someone else's behalf.
investo.toml
!tests/**/investo.toml
